iUNLDMlLan_7CsMm67LmMVL4CFinz7bLz-aoRvDM470gihFp2hmCIa0nShVnkyaUShkUz62M4W7LzMfUzlPnmNsoz7sLRCZLR7ZMzMFMzVVMNU8MlVFLlM7LzCJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7ZLzCJqd9nx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11816&e=.jpeg\"></p></td><td><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vMzL6ZMzlsM8QfU_47iU4vYLmM7Um-FbnlUPM778nzUZUlL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkoSy4n1yiozAfLm-PMm-ZLRviLzffnmn7L8L4MzNsnNVFMRNDnRNsLRMFLzv8oRlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7ZLzCJqd9nx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11816&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BB93F598A22162807510AF4D3C3597FA/496D9703/17485\" vheight=\"133.3300018310547\" vwidth=\"177.6699981689453\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vMzL6ZMzlsM8QfU_47iU4vYLmM7Um-FbnlUPM778nzUZUlL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkoSy4n1yiozAfLm-PMm-ZLRviLzffnmn7L8L4MzNsnNVFMRNDnRNsLRMFLzv8oRlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7ZLzCJqd9nx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11816&e=.jpeg\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>7 月 14 日，实践团继续走访河津多个非遗地，拓宽文化视野。成员们先赴卜子夏祠、司马迁故里，体悟当地崇文重教的千年底蕴；接着前往吕氏灰陶琉璃厂，观摩四百余年御用琉璃烧制流程，亲手体验模具塑形。随后实践团来到山西省民间文艺家协会副主席、省级非遗传承人杨毅先生的工作室，在这里队员们了解到省级非遗“河津剪纸”、“手绘布画”，市级非遗“河津枕顶刺绣”“河东土木印染”。杨老师现场挥剪示范石榴纹样，队员上手实操，在剪刀起落间体会民间艺术的生命力。行程尾声，团队走进汇书非遗文化馆，体验景泰蓝、古法拓印、漆扇制作，近距离观赏盛唐转花灯，感受河津百花齐放的非遗元素。</p><div><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vLz76iM4-iLNW7L_4ARUzQ7LmLDUmvF8M8MfU8MRMN-PLz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nkyZoSysL8-YU4CaLzrVU4LanNLiUl7ZMzf2L4V2L4MFUNV2oRN8nlQFL8WknNUJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7ZLzCJqd9nx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11816&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4D8973B2C6015EC30FC5AA850F31F33/BAF894EF/3BBFD\" vheight=\"133.1999969482422\" vwidth=\"177.6699981689453\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vLz76iM4-iLNW7L_4ARUzQ7LmLDUmvF8M8MfU8MRMN-PLz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nkyZoSysL8-YU4CaLzrVU4LanNLiUl7ZMzf2L4V2L4MFUNV2oRN8nlQFL8WknNUJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7ZLzCJqd9nx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11816&e=.jpeg\"></p></t